# Worklog

Worklog owns committed delivery for {{PROJECT_NAME}}.

## Entry points

- [`Project-Plan.md`](Project-Plan.md) is the task-free master index.
- `Plan-<Area>.md` owns one distinct delivery area.
- [`Verification.md`](Verification.md) records cross-cutting proof.

## Rules

- Put every task in exactly one plan.
- Mark `[x]` only when the required evidence level is met.
- Keep blocked or partially verified work open with its reason.
- Keep unapproved possibilities in Research.
- Generate the plan index rather than editing its generated region.
